[Main]
Name=IADX
Title=Average Directional Index
Group=Алгоритмы (ген)

[Property]
Period=n,12
Price=applied_price,PRICE_CLOSE
Mode=adx_mode,MODE_MAIN

[Output]
out=row

[InputPars]
Start
Size

[Code]
<gvars>
double $out[];

<lines>
  ArrayInit($out);
  CheckShift($out);
  for (int i=$Start; i<$Size; i++)
    $out[i] = iADX(NULL, 0, $Period, $Price, $Mode, $Size-1-i);
    
[Help]
Генератор линий скользящей средней.

